                    # v76.3 proxy test): _px_body/_px_msgs are assigned in
                    # the continue branches below, which made them locals
                    # of sync_worker — so the promise-continue check above
                    # those branches read an UNBOUND _px_msgs and every
                    # plain non-stream proxy reply died with
                    # UnboundLocalError instead of returning. Declare them
